---
title: 연혁
lead: 2023년 창립 이후 케이알앤에이가 걸어온 길입니다.
permalink: /company/history/
---
<section class="sec">
  <div class="wrap">
    <ol class="milestones">
      {% for y in history | reverse %}<li><span class="ms-year">{{ y.year }}</span><span class="ms-phase">{{ y.phase }}</span><strong>{{ y.highlight }}</strong></li>{% endfor %}
    </ol>
  </div>
  <div class="wrap timeline">
    {% for y in history %}
    <div class="tl-year">
      <div><h2>{{ y.year }}</h2><p class="tl-phase">{{ y.phase }}</p></div>
      <ul>{% for it in y.items %}<li><b>{{ it[0] }}</b><span>{{ it[1] }}</span></li>{% endfor %}</ul>
    </div>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>
